title Vinyl P2a: ReplayGain (from tags only, Off / Track / Album; the owner's decision D25): the pick list in each state and the Playback page with each value; square and large show the playing track's gain beside Gapless ("Gapless, RG -3.2 dB") (480x320 and 320x480 at their real density)
sizes 480x320 320x480
ppmm 630
# the 3.5-inch panel's 6.3 px/mm: ROW 44, the approved 480x320 layout's volume group and seek row 43 px (the owner's rule R-4)
allow-small
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE replaygain
env VINYL_DEMO_RG off

wait 900
shot 01-rg-off
expect text "REPLAYGAIN"
tap "Track"
wait 400
shot 02-rg-track
tap "Album"
wait 400
shot 03-rg-album
key left
wait 400
shot 04-playback-album
expect text "Album"
key left
wait 400
key left
wait 400
shot 05-now-rg
expect noquit
